{"id":"618796","name":"腊八饭","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/618796/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄糯米","amount":"1把"},{"name":"香米","amount":"2把"},{"name":"粳米","amount":"2把"},{"name":"红豆","amount":"小许"},{"name":"莲子","amount":"小许"},{"name":"花生","amount":"小许"},{"name":"黑米","amount":"1把"},{"name":"芡实","amount":"适量"},{"name":"绿豆","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"各种豆，加芡实莲子和花生。","img":"images/618796/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放黑豆黄豆和薏米。","img":"images/618796/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净。","img":"images/618796/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放温开水浸泡。","img":"images/618796/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"黑米洗净，放温水浸泡。","img":"images/618796/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取黄糯米和香米。","img":"images/618796/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放粳米。","img":"images/618796/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"淘洗干净。","img":"images/618796/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放纯净水浸泡。","img":"images/618796/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"泡了1小时的豆类。","img":"images/618796/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放黑米。","img":"images/618796/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入高压锅。","img":"images/618796/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"煮半小时。","img":"images/618796/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"豆子煮熟。","img":"images/618796/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放泡好的米拌匀，汤汁跟米持平即可。","img":"images/618796/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再煮23分钟。","img":"images/618796/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"取红糖。","img":"images/618796/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"打开，捣碎。","img":"images/618796/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"做好的腊八饭。","img":"images/618796/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"放红糖拌匀即可。也可以不放红糖，吃原味腊八饭。","img":"images/618796/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/618796/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"忘了放大枣和红糖，只好把红桃捣碎拌在做好的腊八饭里，本来直接跟米一起煮就可以！ \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}